OL,3,AKelsey Parker welcomes baby after
OL,4,A'devastating' stillbirth last year
OL,5,
OL,6,FKelsey Parker, the widow of The Wanted
OL,7,Fsinger Tom Parker, has welcomed a baby
OL,8,Fafter last year announcing a
OL,9,F"devastating" stillbirth.
OL,11,FThe podcaster and author, 35, had two
OL,12,Fchildren with British boy band star Tom
OL,13,FParker before he died in 2022, aged 33,
OL,14,Fafter being diagnosed with terminal
OL,15,Fbrain cancer.
OL,17,FShe is now in a relationship with Will
OL,18,FLindsay and last June revealed the
OL,19,F"earth-shattering news" that they had
OL,20,Flost their baby Phoenix.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
